5.9 Right-Panel Placement Pattern
The Research Overview right panel uses the following Quarto structure:
::: {.column-margin}
&lt;div class="x-updates-panel"&gt;

### Research Discoveries & Publications

*Scientific discovery feeds and selected research papers will appear here.*

&lt;/div&gt;
:::
The RT CrB page uses the same structural approach for Papers of the Week, with the subject changed to spectroscopic eclipsing binaries and related stellar astrophysics. Panel styling is centralized in styles.css; do not duplicate page-specific CSS unnecessarily.
